          "id": 2073396378,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Maybe because if we're at a different depth, the info column might have been cleared by another dissector? This would lead to the first PDU starting with a comma.\n\nI'm not sure, we should ask who wrote it in the first place.",
